OL,3,GNEWSANurse who asked colleague about
OL,4,Asex toys suspended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse has been suspended after he was
OL,7,Ffound to have sexually harassed a
OL,8,Fcolleague by asking her explicit
OL,9,Fquestions.
OL,11,FBenjamin Terkper admitted asking his
OL,12,Fformer colleague about sex toys, if she
OL,13,Fwanted him to find her a "sugar daddy",
OL,14,Fand if she was on her period.
OL,16,FThe offences took place over a period
OL,17,Fof months in 2023 and 2024 while
OL,18,FTerkper was working at a private
OL,19,Fhospital in Oxford, operated by
OL,20,FNuffield Health.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
